			"notes": "Twitch Chat in Minecraft v2.0.0\n\nDisplays your Twitch chat directly in Minecraft. Only you see the messages — other players see nothing.\nWhat's new in v2.0.0:\nChannel is now saved between sessions\nAutostart on world join (/twitch autostart on)\n/twitch reload to reconnect without restarting\nBadge display before username: [mod] [vip] [sub] [streamer] etc.\nSound notification when your nick is mentioned in chat (/twitch sound <nick>)\nRussian and English interface (/twitch language ru/en)\nSupported versions:\nMinecraft 26.1 / Fabric Loader 0.18.5\nMinecraft 1.21.1 / NeoForge 21.1.172\nUsage:\n/twitch channel yourchannel\n/twitch start\nNo token or Twitch login required."
		},
